            "value": {
                "none": [
                    "The fate of a desert kingdom rests in the hands of a princess desperate for power and an assassin with a dark secret, in this action-packed debut of fire magic and ancient prophecy from a stunning new voice in fantasy.\n\nThe Ravani kingdom was born of a prophecy, carved from unforgiving desert sands and ruled by the Ravence bloodline: those with the power to command the Eternal Fire.\n\nElena Aadya is the heir to the throne�and the only Ravence who cannot wield her family�s legendary magic. As her coronation approaches, she will do whatever it takes to prove herself a worthy successor to her revered father. But she doesn�t anticipate the arrival of Yassen Knight, the notorious assassin who now claims fealty to the throne. Elena�s father might trust Yassen to be a member of her royal guard, but she is certain he is hiding something."
                ]
